Key Facilities / Features of S3 Buckets

1. Object Storage
	•	Stores data as objects (file + metadata + unique key)
	•	Supports any file type (images, videos, logs, backups, documents)

2. High Durability & Availability
	•	99.999999999% (11 nines) durability
	•	Data is automatically replicated across multiple AZs

3. Scalability
	•	No limit on storage size
	•	Handles millions of requests per second automatically

4. Security
	•	Bucket policies (JSON-based access control)
	•	IAM policies for user/role access
	•	ACLs (legacy, not recommended now)